  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 722.06 BAT for Residual Disinfectants",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 722.06 BAT for Residual Disinfectants. The technology listed in 40 CFR 141.65(c) shall be the best available technology, treatment technique, or other means available for achieving compliance with the MRDL for disinfectant residuals as specified in Env-Dw 705.04(c).\n\nSource. #12820, eff 6-28-19",
